<title>USA: Rite Aid Q2 Aug 31 shr $0.42 vs $0.37.</title>
<headline>Rite Aid Q2 Aug 31 shr $0.42 vs $0.37.</headline>
<dateline>CAMP HILL, Pa. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.42		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net		 35,209.0		 30,910.0</p>
<p> Revs		1,423,076.0	    1,328,399.0</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  83,890,000	     83,758,000</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.81		    $0.83</p>
<p> Net		 67,925.0		 69,293.0</p>
<p> Revs		2,828,378.0	    2,683,240.0</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  83,878,000	     83,844,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the 26 weeks ending August 31, 1996 reflects a non-recurring pre-tax charge of $16.1 million to write off expenses associated with the attempted acquisition of Revco D.S. Inc.</p>
<p>LIFO accounting reduced net income $0.04 per share for the 13-week period and $0.08 per share for the 26-week period ended August 31, 1996.</p>
